# lifecore_lab (S19a): rate play, live 60 days (past the millis() wrap), reboot, rate again. Expect all 6 checks to pass and identical output on every run.
@+1000 choose 1 1
@+1500 feedback 1 positive 1
@+2000 expect feedback_count == 1
@+3000 day 60
@+4000 expect days == 60
@+5000 reboot
@+6000 expect feedback_count == 1
@+7000 choose 2 1
@+7500 feedback 2 positive 1
@+8000 expect feedback_count == 2
@+8000 expect generation == 2
@+8000 expect persist_failures == 0
